# T22651 read Sensor information. 5 sensors x 5 words per member from 0x1000; floats big-endian.
# Temperatures drift: the reading lines record (~); compare them with the CLI rows printed alongside.
step SETUP
cli configure terminal ;; scada modbus tcp server ;; end
cli show scada modbus tcp server =~ MODBUS is enabled
cli show system environment               # the CLI reference (full text in --out)
step 1 #1 Sensor Type
read 1 0x1000 1 ENUM 2
read 3 0x1000 1 ENUM 2
read 4 0x1000 1 ENUM 2
step 2 #1 Sensor Reading
read 1 0x1001 2 FLOAT ~ member 1 = CLI Temp
read 3 0x1001 2 FLOAT ~ member 3 = CLI Temp
read 4 0x1001 2 FLOAT ~ member 4 = CLI Temp
cli show system environment =~ Temp: System \(Degrees C\)\s+\d+
step 3 #1 Sensor Units
read 1 0x1003 1 ENUM 2 Degrees C
read 3 0x1003 1 ENUM 2
read 4 0x1003 1 ENUM 2
step 4 #1 Sensor Fault Status
read 1 0x1004 1 UINT 0 Ok
read 3 0x1004 1 UINT 0
read 4 0x1004 1 UINT 0
step 5 #2 sensor
read 1 0x1005 1 ENUM 11 LED Output
read 1 0x1006 2 FLOAT 0.0
read 1 0x1008 1 UINT 0
read 1 0x1009 1 UINT 0
read 3 0x1005 1 ENUM 11
read 4 0x1005 1 ENUM 11
step control
read 1 0x1000 25 RAW ~ all five sensors, member 1
read 1 0x1019 5 RAW exc sensor 6 does not exist
step TEARDOWN
cli configure terminal ;; no scada modbus tcp server ;; end
probe 502 refused
